# Lagoon Breach (the Adventure, {1}{U}, instant): Bot2's Llanowar Elves attack on turn 4 and Bot1 casts it from hand with two
# Moxen. "The owner of target attacking creature you don't control puts it on their choice of the top or bottom of their
# library" (CR 108.3): Bot2, the owner, declines the top, so the Elves go to the bottom of Bot2's library. The card Bot1
# cast goes to exile "on an adventure" (CR 715.4), from which the Whale can be cast later.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Horned Loch-Whale
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Horned Loch-Whale.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves; Ability: Adventure)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Decline

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 1
Bot2.Library = Forest; Forest; Forest; Llanowar Elves
Exile = Horned Loch-Whale
Bot1.Life = 20
